{"date":"2026-08-08","report":"\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>신재생 에너지 산업 분석 보고서</title>\n    <style>\n        body { font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }\n        h2 { color: #2c3e50; border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 30px; }\n        h3 { color: #34495e; margin-top: 20px; }\n        ul { list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; }\n        ul ul { list-style-type: circle; margin-left: 20px; }\n        li { margin-bottom: 8px; }\n        b { color: #e74c3c; } /* 강조 텍스트 색상 */\n        a { color: #3498db; text-decoration: none; }\n        a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <h2>신재생 에너지 산업 분석 보고서</h2>\n\n    <h2>주요 이슈 요약</h2>\n    <ul>\n        <li><b>미국 트럼프 행정부의 해상풍력 프로젝트 철회 정책</b>\n            <ul>\n                <li>트럼프 행정부는 RWE를 포함한 여러 기업의 해상풍력 사업권을 총 40억 달러에 가까운 비용을 지불하고 매입하여 프로젝트를 철회하고 있습니다. 이는 미국 내 신재생 에너지 전환에 역행하는 정책으로, 관련 기업의 투자 불확실성을 가중시키고 있습니다. 다만, 미국 법원이 트럼프 정부의 풍력 프로젝트 동결 조치에 대해 위법하다고 판단한 사례도 있어 정책의 향방은 여전히 주목됩니다.</li>\n                <li>관련 기사:\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>트럼프 정부, 1조7400억원 주고 RWE 해상풍력 3곳 철회 - 네이트 (<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE91YXM0Ul9NV2dJR2ozZ3dIazdMUDQ5c1BvNExmbVZTVklHSlV1Sl94VHBxWFZwRi1xRFZfdGZjYWE1aWxfRFNwaW5tNXN4RUZBbklxd1VFbVJuV05BX0tQZg?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>트럼프 정부, 1조7400억원 주고 RWE 해상풍력 3곳 철회 - 뉴스1 (<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTFAwMTgxa0swYUpnNDQyYnRlM0h5ZkZoZXR6TTJuMHNDb21QaWNjUVpFSk9KLV9jB29md0pMMFpmY2VZWnVteEhid201Wko4a3UyT3NMMkVxejU?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>미국 법원 \"트럼프 정부 풍력 프로젝트 동결 조치는 위법\", 해제 명령 내려 - 비즈니스포스트 (<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE5GbzdMRlVoalRTNnFrTDE2Y3o5bDYyME9oOG95TnhDcV9JOWl6WjhDWk1jTDI5cWpQREk1dnM4NnR1SDNxVjBFN1dyZTRPY25GNUdMQVMyTF8wbEhCRUZpdC0yOUQ2SmlFbllhU0NoelU1M00?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>Trump administration’s latest buyback of offshore wind leases brings total to nearly $4 billion - AP News (<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPd3R1ek1NVGttOHhoeDFOU0d2LWpWbFdxSnBYRHAxSnFYZk5hV1NXdWdiMXFzMURWUXR4ZzA1UFhfRUxiRHVfdVJyY1V1X2tmczJ6Mi15SEEtUnhPMERJRUJQNmV0MlVQVS16TFpHdUxSN3M3ZTBISURzZW5iMVhrUjlzUU9fUXZoLWlOd1NGY3Y1RkZlOUdvbWlQSlJnVEZqTzVTVS04WWdTbVhN?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>RWE accepts $1.2bn Trump deal to return offshore wind leases - Wind Power Monthly (<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQWHd5cThmWjZzckw3NzRnWnAwbHdoR2s0ckkya0RWdTY5SlRtTG40UTZKa0pYaUloQXo0TG1zazZGa2xFMjZzVFVoMHJJWW03bU5mbnYyYWZCbkpFamp5cHRXZnVkMWoyZUJQSjhYNjlYYWhVWGprLS1kcFU1UWlqWmQxSEtLREFpYmYxVVF1Nzobiw?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>Trump administration will buy back company's offshore wind leases off 3 states in a $1.2B deal - Bozeman Daily Chronicle (<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>Why Trump’s claim that offshore wind is a security risk is ‘ludicrous’ - Canary Media (<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPS2Q5bno2Q2Y4OWh5ZDd4dkdxaVo3SE1Sczlqa1RhOEZrTVFZRjJjenRFX015WG9TRGtGSV9pNlU1UXpvRHdqckpZQ3dDNjFuYzg1bjVaNTNhWkc3R3NWZWEtdkZETjF0VHdXemtMY3hKbzJ2eG1WZ3BIcWFKX1diNG1UalNWb3lDX1NOeWt3Zw?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>Trump administration's latest buyback of offshore wind leases brings total to nearly $4 billion - The Wenatchee World (<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>Trump administration to pay German firm to halt US wind projects - BBC (<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE1Ea2JGMWFDRGVjQy1Lc3o5ZW44OWVvODlkc05aWElPSHFCQlRkclI2ZzJnQkdpSE9mckE0TzFQRnlrdWR6VEVORExUek1oM21jREtjbGc0WFNudw?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>Trump administration has spent nearly $4B to cancel offshore wind farms - TechCrunch (<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOYnpTX282RVFjMDg2c05NbmpTMDg3RTRpbGdfeFFFa1dxV2M4Y1VOTXpxTDdFT2Y3aHplQ2dfUUE3UVFHSkt1MW82NnF4bjBMd0l0RXZiTF9tN0tCcTNhOUExUTlOMlAteGJkWGJYOTlwS3lzcjdDOUN3X05XS0JVdXA0TUQyM3ZZQm4wN3REMVdjZUFLVUlOdk94bk9fdU1vX1hqX196WUs?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>Trump Refunds to Cancel Offshore Wind Projects Total $4 Billion - EnergyNow.com (<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxPVFlTVkxhXzFMSEU0WFNCcGZrZzlYdGc2UmV4SzE1OTNzczA0UTVtQjFiS0F5NWh5bXdDMXU1X1JWblppenpiN1BKa2tyeHNTQzFRb1c3cXBVc3kwZDBQa2hNY2RUUlpwSnIyMmZfYzN1dFJBeE9RaE96S29TZzlwR21WbnVHaTBZSDZDQ3VMakVRN014TlUwQw?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>Trump administration will pay $1.2 billion to cancel more offshore wind projects, calling it 'common sense' - Reason Magazine (<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>Trump administration pays $1.2 billion to cancel more offshore wind projects - Northeast Times (<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPcS1qYmlKS2lLUVRMVFh1X01obWNxeTVIdUZlN3JqVmEyclBCQmZzeGdEQlZTa2VVak5BRWl0WG9yWWdNMUk5N3Y4azVEcXpyMmZ2dWZzenRtNGlLUk5kTkMxbVotLVZFMzdBb2EwWERZX01XSWlxVFpON0U5dlVSd1daSmtya2JDLWJlejhCOF9MMXAtUlpSSVFiRF8zbGrybDRDN1lFMEpmejQ?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>Trump Administration Spends Another $1.2 Billion To Kill Offshore Wind Farm Projects - Engadget (<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOUzVFRGRld2s3M2pPemZRN3VtdURwRXhncExXaWhEU3NOcHZla0FMR05hUkNmNUcybW5UNmtQaDF4OExnNEtQYldIeHVSUER0LU5KVVUtY0FKOHY5MnJqYnBlZVZqX2hDa3ZCeUZhZXpEZzhtcmlNdFhiNUh0TkVETDBuWjRKS1puOTRSaFZ4cGdJMHd1YVJMMWc4b2EyOHh1eXRZdGEzYk0wWjJrZVZxcFVWNFBsTi1M?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n        </li>\n        <li><b>한국의 해상풍력 개발 가속화 및 금융 지원</b>\n            <ul>\n                <li>국내에서는 전북도, 고창군 및 주요 금융기관(우리은행, 신협)이 동촌 해상풍력 발전사업에 대규모 금융 지원을 약속하며 해상풍력 인프라 구축에 박차를 가하고 있습니다. 또한, 정부는 태양광·풍력 등 6대 전략 산업에 대한 국내 생산 세액 공제를 신설하여 산업 경쟁력 강화를 지원하고 있습니다. 해상풍력 인증 교육 거점 마련을 통한 인력 양성 노력도 돋보입니다.</li>\n                <li>관련 기사:\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>전북도·고창군·금융권, 동촌 해상풍력 금융 지원 맞손 - 더코리아 (<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE0xU3cxaWswaEpEMnZQc2pnZWU0SXd3SmJlclozWjI3QVVud1B5OGVURzJHZ3Voa2lwcUd0RzdFeTJ2VmZISm1JWEhHMUtJdTJxdUxNbGRHT21QdG1FUDFMMDV2ZFpfZFQwUUE4bDBKRkc?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>산업부, 국내생산세액공제 신설…태양광·풍력 등 6대 전략 산업 지원 - 전기신문 (<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>우리은행, 전북 고창해상풍력 산업에 생산적 금융 지원 - 머니투데이 (<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>해양수산연수원, 목포분원에 GWO 해상풍력 인증교육 거점 마련 - 데일리안 (<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>유니슨 \"국내생산세액공제·풍력 인증개편 수혜 기대\" - ER 이코노믹리뷰 (<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE9vSEcwc2Jkck9qVlBtNHl2M0cwUEdreDZtY1F4Mmx5TUhJMER1YXpyNm9VWW1aQ285Vl9SaHZ1Y2NmeERyYmRHMml6WUV0Y2FOVUFOVXY2SG14endHVkFDS1ZCYmNkb0RXc1B6bQ?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>신협, 고창 해상풍력에 1,000억 원 규모 금융지원 - 한국경제TV (<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE5OanNIcVBpRkF1UWxvWUlHNUJpUlNJWnlIWGxkdlR1THp1R0JSbG92ZUMyQkpBSlNFNHV2M3R4Tnl4M1FIUi12OGl0UDJQVmk3SnozSmhLYXFhQmxqZW15ZDE2VldxNHJrbmRWQk1NSnR1LS1kQTBN?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>우리은행, 전북 해상풍력 발전사업에 생산적 금융 투입 - 에너지경제신문 (<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE1hd1NxSm1rcGZhdm9fd2dtSDJSR05zeFhseUtIVFBNMWhHVjYwUWZQMEU3aG4ydmZlVHNEc281WWFDa3JCTDBKd0J4SnZrUVgzQl96MlBsX0F3d1J0Z2lYS0wyZw?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n                        <li>우리은행, 전북 해상풍력 사업에 생산적 금융 4천억 투입 - 뉴스;트리 (<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFBSbzBRZ2JpVWNCUWxFTzZNZ1NyaE1FcVY1NVdFLS0yNnN1dlZVZzVRSndtajRBUnB3Rkk0dVdsdzl3dGhBbWxQSjJjQzVreWZMOWNOem9EdzZSNGpj?oc=5\">링크</a>)</li>\n